You are here, working in this place; I worship You, I worship You

4
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:19,000
이곳에 임재하시는 주님, 주를 예배합니다
You are here, moving in our midst; I worship You, I worship You

5
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:35,000
이곳에 일하시는 주님, 주를 찬양합니다
You are here, working in this place; I worship You, I worship You

6
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:48,000
[후렴] 길을 만드시는 분, 기적의 주, 약속을 지키시는 분
You are Way maker, miracle worker, promise keeper

7
00:01:48,000 --> 00:02:02,000
어둠 속의 빛, 나의 하나님, 그분은 나의 주님
Light in the darkness, my God, that is who You are

8
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:15,000
[후렴] 길을 만드시는 분, 기적의 주, 언약의 하나님
Way maker, miracle worker, promise keeper, Light in the darkness

9
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:30,000
어둠 속의 빛, 나의 하나님, 그분은 나의 주님
My God, that is who You are

10
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:44,000
[2절] 상한 마음 만지시는 주님, 주를 예배합니다
You are here, touching every heart; I worship You, I worship You

11
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:58,000
모든 아픔 고치시는 주님, 주를 예배합니다
You are here, healing every heart; I worship You, I worship You

12
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:12,000
모든 삶을 돌이키시는 주님, 주를 찬양합니다
You are here, turning lives around; I worship You, I worship You

13
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:27,000
부서진 맘 싸매시는 주님, 주를 경배합니다
You are here, mending every heart; I worship You, I worship You

14
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:50,000
[후렴] 길을 만드시는 분, 기적의 하나님, 언약을 지키시는 분
Way maker, miracle worker, promise keeper, Light in the darkness

15
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:19,000
어둠 속의 빛, 그분은 나의 하나님, 신실하신 나의 주
My God, that is who You are, that is who You are

16
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:49,000
[후렴 반복] 길을 만드시는 분, 기적의 주, 나의 하나님
Way maker, miracle worker, promise keeper, that is who You are

17
00:04:49,000 --> 00:05:03,000
[브릿지] 보이지 않아도 주 일하시네, 느껴지지 않아도 역사하시네
Even when I don't see it, You're working; Even when I don't feel it, You're working

18
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:18,000
결코 멈추지 않으시네, 주님은 결코 멈추지 않으시네
You never stop, You never stop working; You never stop, You never stop working

19
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:31,000
보이지 않아도 주 일하시네, 느껴지지 않아도 역사하시네
Even when I don't see it, You're working; Even when I don't feel it, You're working

20
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:46,000
결코 멈추지 않으시네, 주님은 결코 멈추지 않으시네
You never stop, You never stop working; You never stop, You never stop working

21
00:05:46,000 --> 00:06:12,000
[후렴 절정] 길을 만드시는 분, 기적의 하나님, 어둠 속의 빛!
Way maker, miracle worker, promise keeper, Light in the darkness, that is who You are!

22
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:45,000
그분은 나의 하나님, 신실하신 나의 구원자!
That is who You are! That is who You are!

23
00:06:45,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[선포] 모든 이름 위에 뛰어난 주 예수 그리스도!
His Name is above depression, His Name is above loneliness, disease and every name!

24
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:55,000
살아계신 나의 주, 영원한 나의 하나님을 찬양합니다
That is who You are, Jesus, that is who You are!

25
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:23,000
🕊️ 길을 만드시는 신실하신 주님을 영원히 찬양합니다 · 아멘
Giving Praise to the Way Maker, Our Faithful God · Amen
